  <equipmenttech equipmenttechid="shoulders" type="8" name="Shoulder Gearing" wikides="“Responsibilities gravitate to the person who can shoulder them.” -- Tom Stoppard &#x00A;&#x00A;As warfare advanced technologically, obvious weak points had to be protected as well. A broken shoulder could be as lethal as a sharp blow to the neck, and so armor was developed to protect this key area from easy attack.">
