  <equipmenttech equipmenttechid="waist" type="12" name="Belts" wikides="“You got to choose between tightening your belt or losing your pants.” -- Navjot Singh Sidhu &#x00A;&#x00A;The girdle is the piece of armor that holds all the soldier's armor in place. Without the belt he is less protected, moves slower and is less confident. Likewise, the soldier's scabbard is attached to the belt. A belt then, is the very cornerstone of the medieval soldier.">
