  <equipmenttech equipmenttechid="feet" type="14" name="Foot Gear" wikides="“Be sure you put your feet in the right place, then stand firm.” -- Abraham Lincoln  &#x00A;&#x00A;Boots were imperative for medieval combat, offering protection from debilitating foot injuries that could leave a soldier unable to fight.  Like other pieces of armor, foot gear improved to become lighter and less cumbersome on the wearer.">
